  SDD_ST_10_Rejected --> SDD_ST_10_Draft : Expert revises
  SDD_ST_10_Submitted --> SDD_ST_10_Published : L and D publishes exact version
  SDD_ST_10_Published --> SDD_ST_10_Unpublished : L and D unpublishes
  SDD_ST_10_Unpublished --> SDD_ST_10_Draft : create revised working version
  SDD_ST_10_Published --> SDD_ST_10_Draft : create successor draft, retain published<br/>history

